---
import ToolingLayout from "../../layouts/ToolingLayout.astro";
import CopyableCode from "../../components/CopyableCode.astro";
import { InsetText } from "@i-dot-ai-npm/component-library-astro";
---

<ToolingLayout title="Set up Cursor" currentPath="/tooling/cursor">
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Set up Cursor</h1>

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Cursor is a desktop app built on VS Code. If you connect it to the AI
    Gateway it will give you access to any{" "}
    <a class="govuk-link" href="/models">
      available AI model
    </a>{" "}
    (for example, Claude or Gemini).
  </p>

  <figure class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-6">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/gateway-diagram-cursor.svg"
      alt="Diagram showing Cursor connecting to the AI Gateway, which provides access to Claude, Gemini, GPT and other AI models."
      class="govuk-!-width-full"
    />
  </figure>

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Before you start, make sure you have{" "}
    <a class="govuk-link" href="/tooling/get-your-key">
      your AI Gateway key
    </a>
    . Then, to set up Cursor, you need to:
  </p>
  <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
    <li>
      <a class="govuk-link" href="#use-admin-permissions">
        Use admin permissions
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="govuk-link" href="#install-cursor">
        Install Cursor and add your AI Gateway key
      </a>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <InsetText>
    These steps work for most setups. If you run into issues you can't resolve,
    contact us in the #ai-model-gateway-team channel on i.AI Slack.
  </InsetText>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="use-admin-permissions">
    Use admin permissions
  </h2>

  <p class="govuk-body">
    You need (temporary) admin permissions to install software on your Mac.
  </p>

  <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
    <li>
      Select the padlock icon (<strong>Local Admin Management</strong>) on the
      top menu bar.
    </li>
    <li>
      Choose <strong>Install an app</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Select <strong>Start session</strong>, and enter your laptop password.
    </li>
    <li>
      Select <strong>OK</strong>.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <InsetText>
    These permissions last for 10 minutes. Select the padlock to request more
    time.
  </InsetText>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="install-cursor">
    Install Cursor and add your AI Gateway key
  </h2>

  <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
    <li>
      Go to the{" "}
      <a
        class="govuk-link"
        href="https://www.cursor.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Cursor website
      </a>{" "}
      and select <strong>Download for macOS</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Open <strong>Finder</strong> and select your <strong>Downloads</strong>{" "}
      folder.
    </li>
    <li>
      To install Cursor, double-click <code class="app-code">Cursor.dmg</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Select and drag <strong>Cursor.app</strong> into your{" "}
      <strong>Applications</strong> folder.
    </li>
    <li>
      Open <strong>Finder</strong> and select your <strong>Applications</strong>{" "}
      folder.
    </li>
    <li>
      To open Cursor, double-click <strong>Cursor.app</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>Create or sign into your Cursor account (and connect to GitHub).</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 class="govuk-heading-m" id="cursor-add-your-key">
    Add your key
  </h3>

  <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
    <li>
      Copy your AI Gateway key (
      <a class="govuk-link" href="/tooling/get-your-key">
        how to get your key
      </a>
      ).
    </li>
    <li>
      Select the <strong>Settings</strong> cog.
    </li>
    <li>
      Select <strong>Models</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Select <strong>API keys</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Under <strong>OpenAI API key</strong>, add your copied AI Gateway key.
    </li>
    <li>
      Toggle on <strong>Override OpenAI Base URL</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Replace <code class="app-code">https://api.openai.com/v1</code> with:
      <CopyableCode code="https://llm-gateway.i.ai.gov.uk/cursor" />
    </li>
    <li>
      To use Cursor, in the chat window, select <strong>the Cloud</strong> to
      change it to <strong>This Mac</strong> (unless you have a Pro account).
    </li>
  </ol>

  <InsetText>
    You can ask for a Pro license using the{" "}
    <a
      class="govuk-link"
      href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=BXCsy8EC60O0l-ZJLRst2GyktrFdnG9Gm5KxLIS-QYJURDVQRjZORUxFVUFDRlY2RFZUWE9SWFM4SiQlQCN0PWcu&route=shorturl"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Software Request Form
    </a>
    .
  </InsetText>

  <InsetText>
    To renew an expired key, repeat the{" "}
    <a class="govuk-link" href="#cursor-add-your-key">
      Add your key
    </a>{" "}
    steps above with your new key.
  </InsetText>
</ToolingLayout>
